<title>GERMANY: Ifo W.German Aug business climate index 94.4(94.0).</title>
<headline>Ifo W.German Aug business climate index 94.4(94.0).</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German Ifo</p>
<p>economics institute gave the following data from its August</p>
<p>business climate survey:</p>
<p>    West Germany		   Aug 1996   July 1996</p>
<p>     Business climate	    94.4	 94.0 (rev from 94.1)</p>
<p>     Business conditions	 89.1	 89.6 (rev from 89.7)</p>
<p>     Business expectations     99.7	 98.5 (rev from 98.4)</p>
<p>    East Germany		   Aug 1996   July 1996</p>
<p>     Business climate	    103.9	102.9</p>
<p>     Business conditions	 120.9	119.8(rev from 119.7)</p>
<p>     Business expectations     88.5	 87.8 (rev from 87.4)</p>
<p>Note - The headline figure was broadly in line with expectations. Economists polled by Reuters had predicted a small improvement in the west German business confidence index to about 94.5 in August.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
